From: wayondroid
Origin: own

gfxstream-vk as an Android 13 HAL from meson: build the AHB and goldfish
gralloc sources (minigbm only where its header exists), link stubs for
the AHardwareBuffer calls they make, and answer the Android loader's
VkPhysicalDevicePresentationPropertiesANDROID in the guest; the host
decoder aborts on it.

